WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.046 --> 00:00:04.664
Roxy followed the humming sound to Dr. Dean McGreen's farm.

2
00:00:04.665 --> 00:00:07.609
A dog sat in front of the barn.

3
00:00:07.610 --> 00:00:11.044
"You haven't been humming, have you?" Roxy said.

4
00:00:11.045 --> 00:00:14.273
"Woof!" Walden gave a friendly bark.

5
00:00:14.274 --> 00:00:20.269
"Why are you barking, Walden?" a man said. "Oh. Rocket Girl."

6
00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:22.088
Roxy recognized the man.

7
00:00:22.089 --> 00:00:26.755
"You're Dr. Dean McGreen—the scientist studying clean energy."

8
00:00:26.756 --> 00:00:29.255
"That's me!" Dr. McGreen said.

9
00:00:29.256 --> 00:00:31.345
"And my work is paying off.

10
00:00:31.346 --> 00:00:34.653
I've invented the perfect way to protect the environment.

11
00:00:34.654 --> 00:00:42.828
Let me show you."

12
00:00:42.829 --> 00:00:45.478
Dr. McGreen took Roxy inside the barn.

13
00:00:45.479 --> 00:00:47.809
A big machine was humming.

14
00:00:47.810 --> 00:00:50.158
It had a large chamber.

15
00:00:50.159 --> 00:00:54.069
"I was developing a new clean fuel," Dr. McGreen said.

16
00:00:54.070 --> 00:00:57.554
"But I had a little accident and some chemicals spilled.

17
00:00:57.555 --> 00:01:02.425
When I woke up, I had exciting new powers!"

18
00:01:02.426 --> 00:01:05.052
"What do you mean?" Roxy asked.

19
00:01:05.053 --> 00:01:08.284
Dr. McGreen stared at a lawn mower.

20
00:01:08.285 --> 00:01:09.923
His eyes glowed.

21
00:01:09.924 --> 00:01:16.481
Suddenly the lawn mower turned on and zoomed around.

22
00:01:16.482 --> 00:01:19.968
Walden whimpered.

23
00:01:19.969 --> 00:01:24.135
Dr. McGreen's eyes glowed again, and the lawn mower stopped.

24
00:01:24.136 --> 00:01:30.544
"I can control any gas-burning engine with my mind now." Dr. McGreen laughed.

25
00:01:30.545 --> 00:01:33.891
"You stopped all the cars!" Roxy said.

26
00:01:33.892 --> 00:01:38.663
Dr. McGreen nodded. "The air in Metro City is cleaner than ever.

27
00:01:38.664 --> 00:01:42.600
And now I'll do the same for the whole world."

28
00:01:42.601 --> 00:01:45.072
"Huh?" Roxy said.

29
00:01:45.073 --> 00:01:48.583
"Right now I can stop cars only in Metro City.

30
00:01:48.584 --> 00:01:52.023
But this machine will spread my power farther.

31
00:01:52.024 --> 00:01:57.971
When I step inside, I can turn off all gas-burning engines—everywhere!"

32
00:01:57.972 --> 00:02:00.461
"You can't do that," Roxy said.

33
00:02:00.462 --> 00:02:02.771
"We still need some of those cars.

34
00:02:02.772 --> 00:02:05.443
Maybe you can keep working on your ideas.

35
00:02:05.444 --> 00:02:09.448
You'll find a better way to stop people from using gas soon."

36
00:02:09.449 --> 00:02:15.367
Dr. McGreen frowned. "I thought you would understand because you're also a hero.

37
00:02:15.368 --> 00:02:20.251
But it's fine. I'll do it on my own. And you won't stop me."

38
00:02:20.252 --> 00:02:22.982
Dr. McGreen's eyes glowed again.

39
00:02:22.983 --> 00:02:27.152
Vroom! Vroom! A tractor sprang to life.

40
00:02:27.153 --> 00:02:29.025
It came straight for Roxy.

41
00:02:29.026 --> 00:02:30.642
She darted away.

42
00:02:30.643 --> 00:02:35.640
The tractor quickly turned around and came back toward her!

43
00:02:35.641 --> 00:02:39.147
"Grr!" Roxy punched the tractor.

44
00:02:39.148 --> 00:02:43.317
She smashed it to pieces.

45
00:02:43.318 --> 00:02:46.327
Dr. McGreen climbed into his machine.

46
00:02:46.328 --> 00:02:48.414
His whole body glowed.

47
00:02:48.415 --> 00:02:50.610
A car suddenly started.

48
00:02:50.611 --> 00:02:53.702
As it shot forward, Roxy grabbed its front bumper.

49
00:02:53.703 --> 00:02:56.031
The car's rear tires screeched.

50
00:02:56.032 --> 00:02:57.880
Roxy flipped the car over.

51
00:02:57.881 --> 00:03:02.029
The wheels spun in the air, but the car couldn't move anymore.

52
00:03:02.030 --> 00:03:03.617
"Yes!"

53
00:03:03.618 --> 00:03:08.198
Vroom, vroom! The lawn mower sped toward Roxy.

54
00:03:08.199 --> 00:03:10.212
She leaped out of the way.

55
00:03:10.213 --> 00:03:12.069
Suddenly Walden barked.

56
00:03:12.070 --> 00:03:14.997
Roxy looked back.

57
00:03:14.998 --> 00:03:20.101
The lawn mower was zooming toward Walden!

